{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26863","headline":"天竺寺殿前立石 · 姚合","name":"天竺寺殿前立石","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"补天残片女娲抛，扑落禅门压地坳。\n霹雳划深龙旧攫，屈盘痕浅虎新抓。\n苔黏月眼风挑剔，尘结云头雨磕敲。\n秋至莫言长矻立，春来自有薜萝交。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26863.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26863","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}